Conclusion
The repaired sender restores the same batching mechanism as 5dc3d3c and empirically uses sendmmsg with max batch size 32 and send_calls=0. The WSL2 loopback throughput probe remains saturated and should not be treated as an EC2 performance result, but it shows the one-send regression was real and that the repaired path behaves close to the baseline path under the same local conditions.

